# Check out text files with LF on every OS (roadmap item 49): Prettier checks LF, while Git on Windows
# would otherwise rewrite the whole working tree to CRLF and fail the frontend's `prettier --check`.
# Batch files keep CRLF for cmd.exe.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
